19
00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:59.310
Nico Flaig: Also, Lordstart was trivia,

20
00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:06.459
Nico Flaig: And the other consideration is just the DOS vector, but I really don't see how that's a problem.

21
00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:15.379
