Nico Flaig: Yeah, just to give some more context, so, I have an EPF project that builds a Lodestar Builder, and I realized this, basically, that we, like, to make it properly, like, to… I'm not sure Builder does this currently, but…

34
00:04:51.620 --> 00:05:02.859
Nico Flaig: you really wanna support multiple branches on P2Pits, and then I realized, oh, current spec kinda requires you to at least have 3 builders on-chain.

35
00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:08.910
Nico Flaig: To cover these cases, because we have this bit rule, to only allow one bit.

36
00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:12.950
Justin Traglia: Yeah.

37
00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:22.260
Justin Traglia: I was also thinking, like, what if we relaxed that rule so that builders could just submit three different

38
00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:29.250
