39
00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:31.669
Justin Traglia: And parent block route.

40
00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:40.260
Justin Traglia: But, I think this is a bit more restrictive and probably in a good way.

41
00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.189
