70
00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:02.670
potuz: Right, so probably the best

71
00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:15.279
potuz: the best way would be, but that I think it's actually more complex than implementing your PR, but the best way would be, to check if the bid is building on top of your GetProposer head.

72
00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.330
Justin Traglia: Okay.

73
00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:36.890
Dustin: Question-with this? Oh, sorry.

