00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.480
Justin Traglia: There you go, please.

75
00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:50.340
Dustin: Okay. What… I'm not sure if I'm understanding this correctly exactly, if… would this, apropos, the, you know, on… on proposer head, or on the builder's bidding on multiple… on top of multiple, or…

