00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:33.689
Justin Traglia: I mean, it is, it's the… this is the first signed bid seen with a valid signature from the given builder for this lot.

98
00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:42.539
potuz: Yes, but the thing is that you will not… so, different peers would see different beats. That's the whole point.

99
00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:44.929
potuz: You see?

