00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:53.360
potuz: I only propagate my head, I can only have a single valid bid from this builder, because I only have a single head.

102
00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:59.639
potuz: But different peers will have different heads, and those two different piers would propagate different bits.

