118
00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:40.950
potuz: By the time that… by the time that the bid is being propagated, then the view of the chain is already set.

119
00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:53.149
potuz: If only one head is actually viable, then it's fine that we only propagate on that only head. If there are two heads that are viable, we will have peers that have that other head as head.

